# code-is-reduction root (#189 IMPL 3, case a)
library "Pol".

// A `code is` + `definition is` REDUCTION concept. `lowerLocalCodes` catches this
// BEFORE the generic mixed check and raises `emit-reduction-not-active` (case a).
// On the FHIR lane, the lane's OWN lowerLocalCodes pass surfaces it, and the folded
// CQL copy is de-duped — so the FHIR result carries EXACTLY ONE, with success sunk.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult-18-or-older`.
- definition is exists this.
